      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.63 (vs ₹0.066 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.63 (up from ₹0.066 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹3.96b (up 54% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹81.2m (up ₹89.8m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.0% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 29% per year but the company’s share price has remained flat, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
