      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.15 (up from ₹0.05 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹892.0m (up 87% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹20.0m (up 207% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.2% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 41% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
